# Build context is the repo root. Keep host artefacts out of the image so the
# build is reproducible and the layer cache is not busted by local state.
node_modules
**/node_modules
apps/api/dist
apps/web/.next
apps/web/out
**/*.tsbuildinfo
coverage
.git
.github
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
docs
README.md
docker-compose.yml
*.log
.vscode
